<h2>Admin Password Reset Request</h2>

<p>Dear <%= adminName %>,</p>

<p>We received a request to reset your password for your <%= franchise.franchiseName %> admin account.</p>

<p>Click the button below to reset your password:</p>

<% if (resetUrl) { %>
<p>
  <a href="<%= resetUrl %>" style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: <%= franchise.brandColor || '#4CAF50' %>; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; margin: 20px 0;">
    Reset Password
  </a>
</p>
<% } %>

<% if (resetToken) { %>
<p>Or copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>
<p style="word-break: break-all; color: #666666;"><%= resetUrl || resetToken %></p>
<% } %>

<p><strong>This link will expire in <%= expiryHours || 24 %> hours.</strong></p>

<p><strong>Security Notice:</strong> If you didn't request a password reset, please contact the system administrator immediately. This could indicate unauthorized access to your account.</p>

<p>Best regards,<br>The <%= franchise.franchiseName %> Team</p>

